{"id":"293a82ecc624be46","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe.md","title":"初始 goal 闭合仍可能触发非闭合否定","display":"ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe — 初始 goal 闭合仍可能触发非闭合否定","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe","aliases":["72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe"],"display":"ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe — 初始 goal 闭合仍可能触发非闭合否定","depends_on":["[[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§5.1.6–5.1.8, print663–664/PDF675–676; explicit local safety counterexample","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe — 初始 goal 闭合仍可能触发非闭合否定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdb33be2414333e2\" href=\"?note=bdb33be2414333e2\" title=\"72-df-sldnf-safe-pair\">72-df-sldnf-safe-pair</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§5.1.6–5.1.8, print663–664/PDF675–676; explicit local safety counterexample"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>语言有常元 c，一元关系 p、q，以及变量 x。仅有两条子句的程序 P 由下式给出；安全对取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdb33be2414333e2\" href=\"?note=bdb33be2414333e2\" title=\"72-df-sldnf-safe-pair\">72-df-sldnf-safe-pair</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P:=\\{\\langle p(c),\\langle\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle q(c),\\langle-p(x)\\rangle\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P:=\\{\\langle p(c),\\langle\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle q(c),\\langle-p(x)\\rangle\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}(q(c))=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\langle q(c)\\rangle\\notin S^+_P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{vars}(q(c))=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\langle q(c)\\rangle\\notin S^+_P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若单原子 q(c) 在某个安全正集合中，A2 以恒等代入和第二条子句迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-p(x)\\rangle\">\\(\\langle-p(x)\\rangle\\)</span> 也在其中；A3 要求 p(x) 无变量，矛盾。于是 q(c) 不在最大安全正集合。这里没有断言否定 p(c) 的真假或使用“未找到证明即为否证”的闭世界推断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sldnf-safe-pair","status":"resolved","id":"bdb33be2414333e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sldnf-safe-pair","status":"resolved","id":"bdb33be2414333e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言有常元 c，一元关系 p、q，以及变量 x。仅有两条子句的程序 P 由下式给出；安全对取 [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P:=\\{\\langle p(c),\\langle\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle q(c),\\langle-p(x)\\rangle\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}(q(c))=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\langle q(c)\\rangle\\notin S^+_P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle-p(x)\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1524,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-552","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-547","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-an